{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Mike\n\n☎️ Tenna's assistant and partner, a mutual friend of Spamton's — never seen in person at any point in the game, but Ch.5 indirectly confirms he really existed and that his disappearance was real, not just a recurring joke.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton_mike.webp","x":-570,"y":-90,"width":258,"height":190},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**The three impostors**\nBattat, Pluey, and Jongler — each parodies a different fandom theory about who Mike really is: Battat (Small Mike) is a green Pippin in disguise, Pluey wears a visibly ill-fitting suit, and Jongler just juggles instead of convincingly pretending to be Mike. All three get paid the same wage for impersonating him, which suggests that even Tenna himself no longer knows for sure what happened to him.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mikeimpersonators.webp","x":420,"y":-480,"width":220,"height":143},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nCat Mike, Tenna's favorite impostor within the show itself, looks a lot like him — the visual basis for the theory that Mike could actually be FRIEND in disguise, though the game never confirms or even directly hints at it beyond that design coincidence.","x":-760,"y":-588,"width":270,"height":180,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-695,"y":-1005,"width":205,"height":190},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nHis boss and, as far as can be inferred, his close friend — he explicitly warned Tenna not to force Spamton to sign the contract. Mike disappeared shortly after Tenna ignored that warning, a timing coincidence the fandom doesn't consider accidental.","x":-125,"y":-575,"width":270,"height":190,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mike_screenshot_spotlight.png","x":-103,"y":-890,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Everyman**\nWorks more as a meta wink than an actual plot piece — another filler character with a generic name that the fandom loosely connects to Mike just for sharing that same category of \"interchangeable character with no face of their own\".","x":-490,"y":448,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/everyman.png","x":-960,"y":408,"width":251,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s2","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_friend_impostores","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_tenna_friend","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s0","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_everyman_impostores","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}